Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:08.50,Default,,0,0,800,,{\b1\4c&H0000FF&}LAUGHING MAN FANSUBS{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.02,0:00:07.69,Default,,0,0,900,,Angels and demons were circling over me,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.68,0:03:10.58,Default,,700,0,500,,The Truth \N Behind An \N Unfinished Love Story
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.69,0:00:13.40,Default,,0,0,900,,Crossing a brambly path of stars and milky ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.10,0:00:19.07,Default,,0,0,900,,He who does not perceive his calling,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.90,0:00:25.48,Default,,0,0,900,,does not know true happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.08,0:00:31.28,Default,,0,0,900,,Watch in awe! Watch in awe!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.85,0:00:37.02,Default,,0,0,900,,Flying in glory, Flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.62,0:00:42.83,Default,,0,0,900,,Watch in awe! Watch in awe!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.03,0:00:48.23,Default,,0,0,900,,Flying in glory, Flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.33,0:01:00.58,Default,,0,0,900,,I am calling, calling now.\NSpirits rise and falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.05,0:01:06.05,Default,,0,0,900,,To be with you longer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.32,0:01:12.36,Default,,0,0,900,,Calling, calling...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.39,0:01:17.86,Default,,0,0,900,,in the depth of longing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.33,0:01:23.83,Default,,0,0,900,,To stay myself longer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.83,0:01:29.24,Default,,0,0,900,,The flow may swallow you, flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.18,0:01:48.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What are your thoughts on the\NInternational Terrorism Conference?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.69,0:01:51.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If I remember correctly, this is the second\Ntime the SAS has attended the conference.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.69,0:01:56.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They are the first organisation in the world to build a\NCyborg unit and their technical know-how is well maintained.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.11,0:02:00.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Although their "traditions" are\Nstarting to become rather annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.49,0:02:01.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.49,0:02:04.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What do you want to do?\NWe don't leave until tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.50,0:02:08.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Actually, there's a place\NI've been planning to go to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.26,0:02:19.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.22,0:02:23.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,An old friend of mine lives here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.35,0:02:25.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This is a Wine Fund.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.35,0:02:26.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Wine Fund?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.44,0:02:32.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,A type of asset management system that\Nprocures and stores wines for their clients.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.02,0:02:36.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,As the scent and taste of natural\Nwine is extremely difficult to...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.24,0:02:39.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,duplicate synthetically,\Nnatural wine tends to be valued by investors.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.82,0:02:45.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Since the value of wine depends on its\Nvintage, it increases over time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.33,0:02:48.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,In other words, it is a very solid investment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.75,0:02:51.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Pick me up in two hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.96,0:02:54.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Until then, you're free to do as you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.05,0:03:02.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,An old friend, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.76,0:03:04.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.98,0:03:19.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We closed just before you got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.70,0:03:21.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Has it really been two years?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.49,0:03:28.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I was quite surprised when you suddenly\Nwithdrew from politics and headed to England.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.58,0:03:35.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I have more of an interest in\Nbusiness than politics now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.42,0:03:36.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.59,0:03:39.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So... What was it you wanted to talk to me about?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.09,0:03:43.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You're as impatient as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.22,0:03:49.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.23,0:03:57.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It seems that the upper-level management of my bank\Nis orchestrating money laundering for the mafia here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.44,0:03:58.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Money laundering?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.15,0:04:00.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Do you have definitive proof?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.82,0:04:05.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There are files in the administrative\Nroster that have been cleverly disguised.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.95,0:04:09.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It is protected by a strong firewall,\Nso the contents cannot be confirmed,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.04,0:04:11.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but it is most probably a set of shadow ledgers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.83,0:04:16.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The bank takes the mafia's money and\Nconverts it into wine for temporary storage;
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.63,0:04:20.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,the wine is then converted back into currency\Nafter its value increases. Is that their scheme?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.05,0:04:25.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Also, there should be a third party that acts as\Nan intermediary between the bank and the mafia.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.05,0:04:28.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But I haven't been able to discover who they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.72,0:04:32.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If only I could get that evidence,\NI would be able to indict all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.94,0:04:34.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Please, will you help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.52,0:04:37.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Who is the middleman?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.36,0:04:39.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I want you to help me find that out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.23,0:04:45.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I don't want to feign ignorance and be\Nan accomplice in this dirty business.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.45,0:04:47.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But this is England.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.83,0:04:50.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It is entirely outside of my jurisdiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.54,0:04:52.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,One wrong step and it's an act of arrogation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.54,0:04:54.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Furthermore...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.25,0:04:56.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You can't act on personal interest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.34,0:04:59.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That was your mantra.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.63,0:05:00.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.26,0:05:04.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I see... Not possible after all, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.13,0:05:06.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.43,0:05:10.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Anyway, let's stop talking about this now.\NIt's been a long time since we last met.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.72,0:05:13.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,so let's have a lively\Nconversation about old times.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.61,0:05:22.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Er...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.61,0:05:28.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm sorry, but this establishment\Nhas already closed for the day...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.38,0:05:46.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey, make sure that nobody else is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.68,0:05:49.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I wonder what that is...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.26,0:05:52.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There shouldn't be anybody here but the security guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.68,0:05:54.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The noise seems to be coming\Nfrom the front entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.77,0:05:59.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Whoa... Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.25,0:06:18.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Records of backroom deals are crammed in here...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.04,0:06:22.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This will be enough to get me by\Nafter I drop out of the organisation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.21,0:06:24.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How are you getting past the security system?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.63,0:06:29.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I took the firewall terminator with\Nme when I left the organisation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.72,0:06:33.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Good...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.72,0:06:35.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Column E-5 has a good vintage.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.85,0:06:37.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You, stay and watch the two of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.03,0:06:46.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Mmm, there they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.79,0:06:57.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,E-2
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.79,0:06:59.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,E-3
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.08,0:07:01.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,E-4
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.38,0:07:04.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What?! It's not here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.67,0:07:07.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Damn it, why isn't the crucial vintage here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.30,0:07:12.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,A bank robbery, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.26,0:07:13.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's at that branch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.10,0:07:17.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The bank president and the security\Nguard have been taken hostage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.98,0:07:19.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That poses a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.77,0:07:22.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No, rather, it is a blessing in disguise.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.56,0:07:25.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,As long as we secure the perimeter, they will\Nundoubtedly hole themselves up in the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.40,0:07:29.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Prioritise securing the ledgers.\NAccident are quite common during assaults.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.99,0:07:31.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We cannot avoid casualties.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.99,0:07:33.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.50,0:07:40.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Contact the third precinct immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.79,0:07:43.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Huh? The Police?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.59,0:07:52.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey, you half-wit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.68,0:07:53.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.68,0:07:54.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.39,0:07:56.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Come over here for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.81,0:07:58.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What did you say, you old geezer?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.02,0:08:06.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What was that sound?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.86,0:08:09.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Status?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.86,0:08:11.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Unable to locate target.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.65,0:08:13.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Shit. We missed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.82,0:08:14.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Snipers?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.03,0:08:17.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Why did the police get here so soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.33,0:08:19.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You contacted them, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.58,0:08:21.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You really did it this time...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.58,0:08:26.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You cut off all access to the outside yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.38,0:08:31.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Data transmission wires have been severed.\NInter-cyberbrain communication jamming is active.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.34,0:08:34.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The only possibility that remains is...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.72,0:08:42.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,that that thing remained active on\Nthe link despite the power shutdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.73,0:08:44.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But that doesn't feel right...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.81,0:08:48.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,English banks do not trust\Nthe police in principle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.82,0:08:52.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,After all, the security system here\Nconnects to a private security company.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.90,0:08:56.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If unauthorized access to the ledgers was detected by the\Nsystem, the security company should have got here first.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.33,0:09:03.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,In any event, it seems that the identity\Nof the middleman is becoming clearer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.84,0:09:16.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Wine, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.48,0:09:24.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Is that a gift for someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.98,0:09:28.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Well... yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.61,0:09:31.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hmm, I'll take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.90,0:09:34.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What kind of person are you giving the gift to?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.78,0:09:36.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I can wrap the present to\Nsuit the person's character.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.28,0:09:39.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No, this is just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.93,0:10:01.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I never heard anything about the\Npolice being involved in wine dealings.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.93,0:10:03.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Stop bluffing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.72,0:10:06.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There was no gunshot when those snipers fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.64,0:10:10.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The only reason they would be using\Nsilenced weapons is assassination.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.15,0:10:13.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You two are in a critical situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.82,0:10:16.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You can no longer return to the mafia.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.53,0:10:20.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Even if you were to surrender to the police,\Nthere's no guarantee you would survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.32,0:10:21.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.45,0:10:23.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We have hostages.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.83,0:10:27.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Doesn't that mean that they\Ncan't easily make a move?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.41,0:10:29.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No, we have no value as hostages.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.13,0:10:33.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Does that mean that they are\Ntrying to get rid of us as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.34,0:10:34.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Most likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.13,0:10:40.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,"Eliminate all who may have\Nnoticed that the ledgers exist."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.51,0:10:42.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's basic cover-up strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.51,0:10:44.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Any suspicions regarding the\Noutcome can easily be dealt with.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.02,0:10:47.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm affiliated with the Japanese police.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.31,0:10:50.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There is a high possibility that my\Nsuperior is inside that building.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.02,0:10:55.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I request a report on the current situation, disclosure\Nof pertinent information, and to join the operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.23,0:10:56.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Refused!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.61,0:11:00.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We will deal with activities in our jurisdiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.12,0:11:03.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Interfere any more and we'll place you in custody!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.37,0:11:12.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Times like this remind me of how fortunate\Nwe are to have someone like the Chief,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.79,0:11:14.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,who can forge a path through any red tape.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.96,0:11:19.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You two, show me the weapons\Nthat you've brought with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.88,0:11:21.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You also have a map, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.26,0:11:24.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'll formulate a strategy\Nbased on the information.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.18,0:11:25.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.60,0:11:27.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't screw with us, old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.27,0:11:29.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Remember your place!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.98,0:11:38.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.28,0:11:40.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We don't want to be killed this easily, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.41,0:11:45.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You offer your weapons. I will offer my wisdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.00,0:11:49.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We have no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.41,0:11:50.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Be quick about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.50,0:11:57.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Even the press are here...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.63,0:11:59.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That would be the Major's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.51,0:12:04.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This will make it difficult for them to take drastic\Nactions such as using explosives or snipers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.02,0:12:11.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I've done what you asked, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.60,0:12:12.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.44,0:12:16.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You said you had a hand grenade, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.11,0:12:17.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What do you want to do with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.82,0:12:20.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's not like I trust you yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.82,0:12:22.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Try something funny and...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.61,0:12:25.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We need to buy some time if we're going to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.82,0:12:28.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That is their only entrance\Nin the event of an assault.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.62,0:12:31.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We're going to plant a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.12,0:12:33.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,To your positions, quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.79,0:12:38.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The press got here faster\Nthan I thought they would.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.92,0:12:42.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,As we thought,\Nit looks like a raid is our only option.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.18,0:12:54.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,All men are in position!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.40,0:13:01.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We have identified two of the individuals\Nwho were recorded by the security cameras.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.78,0:13:05.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The rest are considered accomplices.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.78,0:13:07.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Remember this well!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.58,0:13:10.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.58,0:13:13.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If the targets resist, show no mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.87,0:13:17.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I shouldn't have to mention that you\Nwill rescue the hostages unharmed!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.30,0:13:25.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,However, killing or capturing the targets takes priority\Nover saving the hostages in any extreme circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.02,0:13:38.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey, you're about to enter a restricted area.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.82,0:13:43.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I have some private business with you, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.24,0:13:50.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What private business is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.59,0:14:03.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I did what you asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.34,0:14:08.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But, it is really all right\Nto rig a trap like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.64,0:14:09.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.14,0:14:11.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Now what should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.01,0:14:13.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Move the unconscious security guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.22,0:14:17.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It'll be too dangerous to leave him\Nhere when the police raid the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.31,0:14:22.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How the hell is that old man so\Nefficient about this type of thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.82,0:14:24.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How should I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.53,0:14:28.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,After you two are finished,\Nsave the shadow ledger data.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.79,0:14:38.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.58,0:14:40.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I've bought us all the time I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.09,0:14:44.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's about time we make\Npreparations to escape as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.64,0:14:56.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,A bomb in the front entrance?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.85,0:14:58.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.73,0:15:03.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm changing the entry point!\NWe'll break in from the apartment next door!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.44,0:15:05.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'll lead the attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.73,0:15:07.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Prepare for all contingencies!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.67,0:15:29.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.88,0:15:30.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.01,0:15:31.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The wine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.01,0:15:32.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.01,0:15:35.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It seems to be of a fairly good vintage.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.68,0:15:36.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.31,0:15:39.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Where are the targets?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.69,0:15:40.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.31,0:15:41.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Did you find them?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.19,0:15:43.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We've discovered a possible hostage!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.61,0:15:44.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He matches the data.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.61,0:15:47.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He's a security guard for this bank.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.90,0:15:50.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He is unconscious,\Nbut he does not appear to be injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.03,0:15:56.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,A sewer system?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.54,0:15:59.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They must have escaped while pretending to resist.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.33,0:16:02.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Secure the rear sewer exits!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.13,0:16:05.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We will continue to pursuit!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.22,0:16:16.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.31,0:16:17.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Call the bomb disposal squad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.81,0:16:20.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There's a bomb on the hostage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.73,0:16:23.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Damn it, the bomb in the entrance was a decoy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.10,0:16:25.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Those bastards, trying to buy time with tricks...!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.40,0:16:33.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Now, how would the Chief escape after this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.41,0:16:35.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hurry up and disarm the thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.37,0:16:40.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.46,0:16:43.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's just an alarm clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.92,0:16:48.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It was a decoy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.42,0:16:51.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What is the status of the other pursuit team?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.92,0:16:53.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Have they secured the targets at the rear exits?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.93,0:16:55.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We have blocked off all routes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.22,0:16:58.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They have nowhere to run!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.93,0:17:03.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We have blocked off all the\Nexits to the sewer system,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.85,0:17:04.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but we haven't found them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.94,0:17:07.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They've disappeared into thin air.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.07,0:17:09.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.36,0:17:12.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Expand the perimeter and conduct\Na thorough search of the sewers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.07,0:17:15.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Find them at all costs, understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.95,0:17:20.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Where could they have escaped?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.38,0:18:12.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Well, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.09,0:18:16.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What would you have done if I hadn't noticed this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.47,0:18:18.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I knew you'd find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.55,0:18:23.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,My apologies for the delay... but they\Ntook their sweet time clearing out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.68,0:18:26.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Or, would you have preferred\Nme to arrive even later?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.52,0:18:36.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,In that case, the temperature- and\Nhumidity-sensitive wines would have been sacrificed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.24,0:18:39.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We put quite a few bottles put there, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.74,0:18:43.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hmm... a hidden wine cellar, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.54,0:18:48.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It seems the higher-quality wines were\Nstored in a different location altogether.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.96,0:18:51.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Give up on the wine this time around.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.25,0:18:54.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If you do, I'll let you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.76,0:18:59.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Thanks to you, we obtained data\Non the shadow ledgers, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.76,0:19:03.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Well? To be in such a\Nsituation and still be alive...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.14,0:19:06.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't you think you should be grateful?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.86,0:19:17.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Are you okay with letting them go like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.86,0:19:21.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Even though it ended as a mere attempt,\Nthey certainly qualify as criminals.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.95,0:19:25.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hmph. Well, it doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.54,0:19:27.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,After all, it's out of my jurisdiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.17,0:19:35.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They still cannot find them?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.59,0:19:41.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Did you find them?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.51,0:19:43.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Excuse me, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.39,0:19:46.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,A man named Aramaki is here to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.39,0:19:47.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.23,0:19:57.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What you see here is documentation of past illegal\Ndealings; this proves your relationship with the mafia.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.65,0:20:01.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It was a well thought-out method of money\Nlaundering that did not leave any traces,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.24,0:20:04.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but you should have maintained your\Nregard for the value of human life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.95,0:20:08.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Where have you been hiding all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.34,0:20:24.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,"In wine, truth."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.43,0:20:30.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That is an English saying, is it not?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.45,0:20:50.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I've handed over the data to British Public Safety.\NWe've provided the catalyst for the investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.83,0:20:53.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They will continue the search.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.00,0:20:57.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm sorry to get you involved\Nin something so troublesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.30,0:21:00.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But thanks to you, I was saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.59,0:21:02.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.39,0:21:06.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.51,0:21:09.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Eh, me helping you was natural considering the\Ncircumstances; no need for you to concern yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.89,0:21:13.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Well then, allow me to excuse myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.69,0:21:15.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Send your husband my regards.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.69,0:21:18.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What? Oh, this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.78,0:21:22.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I intended to keep quiet about this,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.49,0:21:25.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but at that time, I never did get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.28,0:21:29.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The reason I still came here is because\NI wanted to stand on my own two feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.08,0:21:32.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This is just to discourage men.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.33,0:21:40.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey, can't you delay your\Ndeparture by just one day?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.63,0:21:45.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No; unfortunately,\NI left behind a huge pile of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.05,0:21:50.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I see... Then,\Ntake this as a thank you for your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.85,0:21:54.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If possible, I wanted us to\Ndrink it together, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.61,0:22:00.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.90,0:22:02.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This is from my personal collection.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.08,0:22:16.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You know, I wouldn't mind at all if you\Nhappened to delay your return by another day.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.21,0:22:21.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Just like wine, some human\Nrelationships require time to ripen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.00,0:22:23.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't trouble yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.76,0:22:34.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I won't be able to go through customs with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.85,0:22:39.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major, have a drink with me\Nwhen we get back to the hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.48,0:22:41.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh, what good timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.98,0:22:43.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I just bought this this afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.86,0:22:46.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hmph, I'd expect no less from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.56,0:23:19.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She's so cold and human
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.44,0:23:22.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's something humans do
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.44,0:23:27.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She stays so cold in her soul, she's so number 9
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.74,0:23:30.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She's incredible math
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.74,0:23:35.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Just incredible math
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.20,0:23:39.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,And is she really human?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.62,0:23:42.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She says there's something new
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.50,0:23:47.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But wake a lithium flower, just about to bloom
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.63,0:23:50.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I smell lithium now
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.34,0:23:55.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Smelling lithium now
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.72,0:23:59.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How... is she what she doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.93,0:24:00.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.64,0:24:03.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How... is she what she doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.02,0:24:05.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.61,0:24:07.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How is she when she doesn't suffer
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.61,0:24:10.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I wonder what she does when she wakes up
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.11,0:24:14.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,When she wakes up
